         <div type="bio">
            <p>Wife of <name type="person" key="budg82">Frank Budgen</name>, married in October 1924. She was born in The Hague, raised in Belgium, and moved to England as a teenager. She met Frank Budgen through the International Socialist Club in the 1920s. <hi rend="bold">William Brockman</hi>
                </p>
